23
00:01:01,170 --> 00:01:04,240
- What did we say about being a nicer friend? - Thank you.

24
00:01:04,240 --> 00:01:08,040
Lenard, what did we say about being a gullible weenie?

25
00:01:08,040 --> 00:01:11,080
